10	/**
11	 * Rejects a create-owner request once the maximum number of owners has already been
12	 * created for its business day, responding 429. The day is the request's effective
13	 * registration date (supplied, else the server date) rolled forward onto a business
14	 * day: at most {@value #DAILY_LIMIT} owners may carry that adjusted date. Runs after
15	 * {@link ValidateOwnerFields} and before {@link BuildOwner}, so the owner being created
16	 * is not yet counted.
17	 */
18	public class EnsureDailyCreateLimit {
